Model weights (not included)
----------------------------
tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it, s2tok_252.pt from https://huggingface.co/AppliedIntuitionResearch/S2Tok:
CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial use only (WEIGHTS_LICENSE.md). The weights are fine-tuned from ZipSplat (CC BY-NC 4.0), initialised
from DA3-Giant (CC BY-NC 4.0), and trained on DL3DV-10K (non-commercial terms) and RealEstate10K; their terms apply too.

